IMPORTANT NOTICE REGARDING GOVERNMENT DATA

The document checklists, requirements, and portal links included in this
software are compiled from publicly available official Indian government
sources for citizen guidance purposes only. This data is:

  - Not guaranteed to be current, complete, or applicable to every situation.
  - Subject to change by the relevant government departments at any time.
  - Provided as general guidance only — not legal or official advice.

DocReady is an independent civic technology tool. It is NOT affiliated with,
endorsed by, or operated by any Indian government department, ministry, or
statutory body (including but not limited to MEA, MoRTH, MoCA, or ECI).

Citizens must always verify document requirements on the official government
portal before visiting any government office.

